  "RECOVERY AID - NOT THE AUTHORITY. The authoritative artifact for each review is the SIGNED",
  "marker in that PR's own body ('review recorded: ... @ <40-hex> ... sig=<hmac>'), which travels",
  "with the PR and is verified by ai-review-gate. Rebuild a lost local record from it with:",
  "  scripts/record-review.sh --recover-body <PR> daniel-ospina/agent-infra",
  "Why this file exists: ~/.pi/agent/reviews/*.json is per-box (4081 records lived on one laptop",
  "that was destroyed on 2026-11-03). Scope: records whose PR was OPEN at snapshot time only.",
  "",
  "Reading the fields: head_sha is the commit the review was BOUND to; live_head_sha is where the PR",
  "was when this snapshot was taken - when they differ the record is stale for the merge gate, but the",
  "signed marker (and thus recoverability) is unaffected. sig is taken from the body marker matching",
  "head_sha, else one matching diff_sha256, else null when no marker carries it yet - null means the",
  "verdict is present in the recovered file but was never published, and cannot be re-signed without a",
  "review-artifact reference (record-review.sh fails closed on that, by design)."
 ],
